---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={metaTitle} description={metaDescription} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />

		<main id="main">

			{/* ─────────────── HERO ─────────────── */}
			<section class="hero">
				<div class="wrap hero-grid">
					<div class="hero-copy">
						<p class="kicker rv"><span class="kicker-tick" aria-hidden="true"></span>EARLY ACCESS 2026 · FOR CAs, ACCOUNTING TEAMS &amp; FIRMS</p>

						<h1 class="hero-title rv">
							Your firm’s repeat work, done in minutes —
							<span class="accent">and proven line by line.</span>
						</h1>

						<p class="hero-sub rv">
							Tax audits, GST, TDS, reconciliations — the work your team rebuilds by hand every week. Accountic does it in minutes, checks every figure against the rules, and posts it straight into Tally. You review and sign. Nothing reaches your books that can’t be proven.
						</p>

						<div class="hero-cta rv">
							<a class="btn btn--solid" href="https://app.accountic.in/signup">Start free — ₹1,000 in credits</a>
							<a class="btn btn--line" href="#modules">
								See what’s live today
								<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
							</a>
						</div>

						<p class="hero-note rv">No card · ₹1,000 in credits to try everything · cancel anytime</p>

						<ul class="trust rv" aria-label="Platform compliance and trust signals">
							<li>Built by CAs</li>
							<li>Data stays in India</li>
							<li>DPDP-ready</li>
							<li>SOC 2 Type II infrastructure</li>
							<li>Posts into your Tally</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

